# Generic AI editor adapter

Read `AI_START_HERE.md` before substantive action. It is the sole provider-neutral entry and authority contract.

Then follow `.exocortex/AI_BOOTSTRAP.md` for command discovery and `.exocortex/reference/MEMORY.md` for project orientation. Without exact current authority and a registered guarded executor, remain read-only and perform no egress. Never read or expose secret values or `.env` contents.
